  "prefLabel": "Env-Wq 502.25 Green project",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Env-Wq 502.25 “Green project” means an infrastructure project that:\n\n(a) Uses natural systems in place of or to supplement existing infrastructure to protect water resources; or\n\n(b) Incorporates water or energy efficiency improvements or other environmentally-protective measures as defined by federal capitalization grants.\n\nSource. (See Revision Notes #1-#3 at chapter heading for Env-Wq 500) #10984, eff 12-1-15; ss by #13511, eff 12-20-22 (formerly Env-Wq 502.24)",
